<task id="t_access-autofill-settings">
  <title>Manage Saved Form Information</title>

  <shortdesc/>

  <prolog>
    <author>Makayla Muñoz / Google Chrome Help</author>

    <copyright>
      <copyryear year="2026"/>
    </copyright>
  </prolog>

  <taskbody>
    <p>To manage your saved autofill information:</p>

    <steps>
      <p>
        <step>On your computer,<cmd>open Chrome.</cmd></step>

        <step>At the top right,<cmd>select<menucascade>
            <uicontrol>More</uicontrol>

            <uicontrol>Passwords and autofill</uicontrol>
          </menucascade>.</cmd> You can also select your <menuscade>
            <uicontrol>profile picure</uicontrol>

            <uicontrol>Passwords and autofill</uicontrol>
          </menuscade>.</step>
      </p>
    </steps>

    <p>You can manage your autofill information for forms like:</p>

    <p>
      <ul>Google Password Manager</ul>

      <ul>Payments</ul>

      <ul>Contact Information</ul>

      <ul>Identity Documents</ul>

      <ul>Travel</ul>
    </p>
  </taskbody>
</task>
